关于原始资料 / About the source material

本仓库中的结构化方剂记录整理自《妙用偏方秘方》（易磊 主编）。原书著作权
归原作者及出版方所有，本仓库不含原始 PDF、整页扫描图像或行级全文转录，
仅包含为检索与安全提示目的整理的结构化字段。

The structured formula records in this repository are derived from the book
《妙用偏方秘方》 (editor: 易磊). Copyright in the book remains with its author
and publisher. This repository does not contain the original PDF, page images,
or line-level full-text transcription; it contains only structured fields
prepared for retrieval and safety annotation.

