医师或药师。来源转录核对不代表临床有效性或安全性评价。

This project is a reference-organisation tool. It does not provide medical
advice, diagnosis, or prescriptions. Consult a licensed physician or pharmacist
for any health concern. Source-transcription checking is not a clinical
